# counter harness. One force call is one ext_pot evaluation.
# The potential is morse_bulk, cutoff 7, shifted, orthorhombic minimum image.
# sd_alpha, sd_twopoint, and max_move are omitted, so the client keeps its constructor step.
# v2 success is under the cap, at the force stop, and Hessian index 0.
# Stock steepest descent on the harness Morse bulk potential. opt_method is sd. converged_force is the problem force norm, 0.001. max_iterations is the problem cap, 10000. sd_alpha, sd_twopoint, and max_move are omitted, so r2549 keeps its constructor step, 0.1, and its constructor max move, 0.2. The client is the Fortran r2549 build. Force calls are HarnessCounter charges through ext_pot.
